### [MCVA] MILITARY CONSTRUCTION, VETERANS AFFAIRS, AND RELATED AGENCIES
VA Medical Services is appropriated $59,858,000,000 [[num:src_mcva_08c9a69c_0df6_4857_9061_9c15f3e960f6_1]] for FY2026, plus reimbursements, available on October 1, 2026 and through September 30, 2027.

It covers: 
- inpatient and outpatient care and treatment for VA beneficiaries and certain veterans, including care in non-Department facilities;
- medical supplies and equipment, bioengineering services, food services, and salaries and expenses of healthcare employees hired under title 38;
- caregiver assistance and support services, loan repayments, monthly assistance allowances, and grants;
- administrative expenses needed to carry out those care programs, plus hospital care and medical services authorized by law [[num:src_mcva_08c9a69c_0df6_4857_9061_9c15f3e960f6_1]].

